{"id":15336,"date":"2025-10-27T06:54:14","date_gmt":"2025-10-27T06:54:14","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=15336"},"modified":"2026-07-29T06:36:33","modified_gmt":"2026-07-29T06:36:33","slug":"affiliate-marketing-amazon","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/affiliate-marketing-amazon\/","title":{"rendered":"Affiliate Marketing on Amazon India: Commission &amp; Details 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>When it comes to earning online, few platforms are as beginner-friendly as affiliate marketing on Amazon. Through Amazon\u2019s affiliate program, you can recommend millions of products available on the world\u2019s most trusted marketplace and earn a commission on every sale.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The best part?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Getting started doesn\u2019t require technical skills or investment. If you\u2019re wondering how to begin affiliate marketing with Amazon, this guide will explain everything, from creating your account to generating links, promoting products, and scaling your income step by step.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is Amazon Affiliate Marketing Program?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Amazon Affiliate Marketing, also known as the Amazon Associates Program, is a way for you to earn money by promoting products sold on Amazon. You don\u2019t create or stock the products; you simply recommend them using special affiliate links.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Whenever someone clicks your link and buys, you earn a small commission from Amazon.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Examples of Amazon Affiliate Marketing in India<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Many Indian YouTubers are already earning through Amazon affiliate links by naturally recommending products in their content:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tech Creators (Gadgets &amp; Electronics)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Creators like Technical Guruji (Gaurav Chaudhary) and Trakin Tech (Arun Prabhudesai) review smartphones, laptops, and gadgets. In their video descriptions, you\u2019ll often find Amazon links for the exact products. If viewers buy through those links, the creators earn a commission.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Lifestyle &amp; Home Creators<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>YouTubers like Sejal Kumar or Komal Pandey share lifestyle videos, fashion hauls, or home d\u00e9cor setups. They add affiliate links for clothes, makeup, or accessories they feature, making it easy for followers to shop directly on Amazon.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Education &amp; Book Review Channels<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Creators like Study IQ Education or book reviewers such as SeeKen recommend study materials, self-help books, or novels. They include Amazon affiliate links in their video description, so students and readers can buy instantly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Cooking &amp; Food Channels<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Popular cooking YouTubers like Kabita\u2019s Kitchen often showcase utensils, mixers, or ingredients. Many of them link these kitchen tools via Amazon Associates, earning a small commission whenever viewers purchase the same products.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Gaming Creators<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Indian gaming creators like Dynamo Gaming or Mortal sometimes share details of their gaming gear (headphones, mics, or chairs). Affiliate links to Amazon are added in descriptions so fans can check and buy the same setup.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Notice<\/strong> how these creators don\u2019t push products directly. They focus on valuable content and simply add Amazon affiliate links in their descriptions or pinned comments. This makes it natural, helpful, and profitable.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Read More:<\/strong> <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-make-money-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How to Make Money in Digital Marketing? 12 Best Ways<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How Amazon Affiliate Marketing Works?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Let\u2019s understand how Amazon affiliate marketing program works:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Sign Up for the Amazon Associates Program<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>You first need to create your free Amazon affiliate account (Amazon Associates). Once approved, you\u2019ll get access to a dashboard where you can generate special affiliate links for millions of products available on Amazon.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Choose Products to Promote<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Pick products that match your niche and audience. For example, if you run a tech blog, you might choose laptops or smartphones. If you run a cooking channel, you can promote kitchen appliances. The key is recommending items that people trust and want.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Generate Your Affiliate Links<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Using Amazon\u2019s SiteStripe tool or Associates dashboard, you can easily create unique affiliate links for the products you want to share. These links track who clicks them and what they buy, ensuring you get credit for the sale.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Share &amp; Recommend Products<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Now, you add those affiliate links to your blog posts, YouTube descriptions, Instagram bios, or even newsletters. Whenever your audience clicks your link, they are taken directly to Amazon to check the product.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Earn Commission on Every Sale<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>When someone buys a product through your link, you earn a commission (up to 10%, depending on the category).&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>The best part? Even if they buy a different product instead of the one you recommended, you still earn commission as long as the purchase happens within Amazon\u2019s 24-hour cookie window.<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <