                              \n                                <a target=\"_blank\"\n                                   href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/seo-course?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_course_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\"\n                                   class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm\">\n                                    Learn More\n                                <\/a>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n                \n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n    \n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Join Amazon Affiliate Program in India?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>If you\u2019re wondering how do you become an Amazon affiliate, then below is the process:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 1: Visit the Amazon Associates Website<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Go to the official Amazon Associates website (for India: <a href=\"https:\/\/affiliate-program.amazon.in\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">affiliate-program.amazon.in<\/a>). Click on the \u201cSign Up\u201d button to begin and create the Amazon affiliate account.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 2: Sign in with Your Amazon Account<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you already have a regular Amazon account, you can use the same login. If not, create a new Amazon account\u2014it\u2019s free and quick.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 3: Enter Your Account Information<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Provide your name, address, phone number, and preferred payment method. Make sure these details are correct, as they will be used for commission payments.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 4: Add Your Website or Platform Details<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Amazon asks where you plan to promote its products. You can add your blog, YouTube channel, app, or social media pages. If you don\u2019t have a website, you can still apply with your YouTube or Instagram account.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 5: Set Up Your Profile<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Choose your preferred niche categories (like electronics, books, fashion, etc.) and explain how you plan to drive traffic (SEO, social media, YouTube, etc.). This helps Amazon understand your promotional strategy.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 6: Verify Your Account<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Amazon will ask you to confirm your identity by entering a phone number. They\u2019ll send you a PIN for verification. Enter it to continue.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Step 7: Start Using Affiliate Links<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Once approved, you can log in to your Amazon Associates dashboard (Amazon Associates Central). From here, you can search for products and generate affiliate links.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong><em>Important Note for Beginners: <\/em><\/strong><em>Amazon requires you to make at least 3 qualified sales within the first 180 days of joining. If you fail, your account may be closed, but you can reapply later.<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Also Read: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-make-money-with-ai\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">How to Make Money With AI? 10 Ways<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How to Get Amazon Affiliate Link?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Once your account is approved, you can start generating affiliate links for millions of products. Below is how to get affiliate links from Amazon:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Log in to Amazon Associates Central<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Visit Amazon Associates Central.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Sign in using the account you registered with.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>This is your main dashboard where you\u2019ll track earnings and create affiliate links.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Use the Amazon SiteStripe Tool<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>When logged in, go to Amazon\u2019s main shopping site.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>At the top of the page, you\u2019ll see a toolbar called SiteStripe. This tool allows you to create affiliate links directly while browsing products.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. Search for the Product You Want to Promote<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Type the product name (for example, \u201cBoat Wireless Headphones\u201d) in Amazon\u2019s search bar. Open the product page you want to recommend to your audience.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Generate Your Affiliate Link<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>On the SiteStripe toolbar, click \u201cText\u201d for a simple link, \u201cImage\u201d for a product banner, or \u201cText + Image\u201d for a combined link. Copy the generated affiliate link. It will have your unique affiliate ID embedded.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Add the Link to Your Content<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Place the link in your blog posts, YouTube descriptions, Instagram bio, or email newsletters.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Use natural calls-to-action like \u201cCheck Price on Amazon\u201d or \u201cBuy Now on Amazon\u201d.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Always include an affiliate disclosure (e.g., \u201cAs an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases\u201d).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n        <div class=\"container position-relative mb-2\">\n            <div class=\"row pb-4\">\n                <h2 style=\"font-size:32px\">Upcoming Masterclass<\/h2>\n                <p>Attend our live classes led by experienced and desiccated instructors of Wscube Tech.<\/p>\n            <\/div>\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel myOwl\">\n            <div class=\"item\">\n                <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/events\/cracking-meta-google-ads-2026-data-automation-attribution?utm_source=WsBlog&#038;utm_medium=blog_master_class_slider&#038;utm_campaign=SEO\" target=\"_blank\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/deen3evddmddt.cloudfront.net\/uploads\/master-class-media\/1a_-_2026-07-31T112145_393_1785491880854_775860.webp\" alt=\